message: string A short description of the error. The message SHOULD be limited to a concise single sentence. Inherited from Error. message data?: unknown Additional information about the error. The value of this member is defined by the sender (e.g. detailed error information, nested errors etc.). Inherited from Error. data code: -32603 The error type that occurred. Overrides Error. code
